# Derived / generated -- never commit
Binaries/
Intermediate/
# Saved/ is per-project untracked scratch (AutoScreenshot.png, Diagnostics/,
# recent_scenes.json) -- with ONE committed exception. `Saved/*` rather than
# `Saved/` is load-bearing: git cannot re-include a path whose PARENT
# DIRECTORY is excluded, so the negation below only works against a pattern
# that excludes the CONTENTS. Everything else under Saved/, directories
# included, is still ignored exactly as before.
Saved/*
# The --offscreen layout seed. Shared by every agent run on every machine, so
# it must be committed rather than machine-local: it is the one thing that
# makes an offscreen editor capture reproducible across desks.
!Saved/verify-layout.ini

# Golden harness failure artifacts -- the golden PNG itself IS committed;
# only the failure-run byproducts (a mismatch's actual capture + diff viz)
# are ignored.
Goldens/*.actual.png
Goldens/*.diff.png
